text arx_lex_c0 "remember\nmemorize\nmemorise\nstore\nsave\nkeep in mind\nnote for memory\ndo not forget\nfact\nmemory"
text arx_lex_c1 "prefer\npreference\nrather\nfrom now on\ni like\nalways\ntone\nstyle"
